.TH xml_get_attribute_double 3
.SH NAME
xml_get_attribute_double \- retrieve an attribute as a double
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "double xml_get_attribute_double(xmlnode *" node ", const char *" attr ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_get_attribute_double
retrieves the value of attribute
.I attr
and parses it as a floating-point number using
.BR scan_double (3).
Returns the parsed value or 0.0 if the attribute is missing or invalid.